## 🎨 UI Assets & Dashboard Warning Lights (Audi Theme)

The project includes a suite of minimalist, high-fidelity vector icons designed to replicate the Audi Virtual Cockpit aesthetic. These assets are built entirely in **Scalable Vector Graphics (SVG)** format, allowing them to remain perfectly sharp across all screen resolutions and dynamically change colors based on real-time TCU/ECU data streams.

### 📂 Directory Structure

Ensure the assets are organized as follows within your project workspace:

```text
VW-Group-TCU-Calibrator/
├── Euro Drive Tcu/
│   ├── assets/
│   │   ├── images/
│   │   │   ├── warning_lights/
